<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>EasyLabel Bulk Template Upload</title><style>body{font:15px system-ui;background:#f4f7fc;color:#182538;margin:0}.wrap{max-width:760px;margin:48px auto;background:white;padding:32px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 10px 35px #14213d13}h1{margin:0 0 8px}p{color:#667085}button{background:#1769ff;color:white;border:0;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer}input{margin:22px 0}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f1f5f9;padding:18px;border-radius:10px}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:#1769ff">← EasyLabel Admin</a><h1 style="margin-top:16px">Bulk Template Upload</h1><p>Upload one ZIP with up to 200 EasyLabel EPL JSON templates. Files remain <b>pending</b> and hidden from regular Android users until the Master Admin configures and publishes each template.</p><form id="f"><input type="file" name="file" accept=".zip" required><br><button>Upload to Pending</button></form><pre id="result">Select a ZIP to begin.</pre><p>Master Admin Android endpoints: <code>GET /api/template-bulk/pending</code> and <code>PATCH /api/template-bulk/:id/publish</code>.</p></main><script>document.getElementById('f').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const o=document.getElementById('result');o.textContent='Uploading...';try{const access=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('access')||'';const headers=access?{'X-Template-Bulk-Token':access}:{};const r=await fetch('/api/template-bulk/upload',{method:'POST',headers,body:new FormData(e.target)});o.textContent=JSON.stringify(await r.json(),null,2)}catch(err){o.textContent=err.message}}</script></body></html>